00:14:03.938 --> 00:14:06.808
Please. Mas gusto mo ang tiramisu.

00:14:08.408 --> 00:14:09.408
Sige lang, Yeong Ra. Patayin mo sila.

00:14:13.378 --> 00:14:15.178
Binabati kita, sinta!

00:14:15.878 --> 00:14:17.218
Ngayon, malaya ka na!

00:14:18.018 --> 00:14:19.888
Ang dami mo nang pinagdaanan, Yeong Ra.

00:14:20.658 --> 00:14:21.658
Binabati kita.

